 runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids May to June and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 34 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle ran 166% of normal in July to August and 34% in November to December. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 36% and April to May at 38% on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
